    {
      "title": "springdoc-openapi and Swagger UI: The Mental Model",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "springdoc-openapi and Swagger UI: The Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What springdoc Does",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Controllers",
                    "sub": "MVC / WebFlux",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Startup scan",
                    "sub": "springdoc",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "x",
                    "text": "OpenAPI 3 spec",
                    "sub": "JSON / YAML",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Swagger UI",
                    "sub": "static viewer",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "springdoc ==scans controllers== on first docs request",
                "Swagger UI only **renders** the spec",
                "A basic spec needs ==no code changes=="
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Starters, URLs, springfox",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Need",
                "Use"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "WebMVC (Boot 3+)",
                  "`springdoc-openapi-starter-webmvc-ui`"
                ],
                [
                  "WebFlux",
                  "`springdoc-openapi-starter-webflux-ui`"
                ],
                [
                  "Spec JSON",
                  "`/v3/api-docs`"
                ],
                [
                  "Spec YAML",
                  "`/v3/api-docs.yaml`"
                ],
                [
                  "Swagger UI",
                  "`/swagger-ui/index.html`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "springdoc",
                "springfox"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Spec",
                  "OpenAPI 3",
                  "Swagger 2"
                ],
                [
                  "Boot 3",
                  "{green:works}",
                  "{red:breaks}"
                ],
                [
                  "Status",
                  "maintained",
                  "stalled"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Gotchas",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Old `springdoc-openapi-ui` is ==Boot 2 only==",
                "Wrong starter on Boot 3 → **blank UI** or startup errors",
                "springfox on the classpath → same breakage"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "One docs library",
              "text": "Use ==exactly one== docs library: the right springdoc starter, no springfox."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Documenting Endpoints and Schemas",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Documenting Endpoints and Schemas",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Endpoint annotations",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Annotation",
                "Goes on",
                "Sets"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`@Tag(name)`",
                  "controller",
                  "groups endpoints"
                ],
                [
                  "`@Operation(summary, description)`",
                  "method",
                  "title and text"
                ],
                [
                  "`@ApiResponse(responseCode, description, content)`",
                  "method",
                  "one status code"
                ],
                [
                  "`@Parameter`",
                  "parameter",
                  "describes the input"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Schemas and global metadata",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`@Schema(description, example, requiredMode, accessMode)` on DTO classes and fields",
                "==Bean Validation== (`@NotNull`, `@Size`, `@Min`) becomes constraints **automatically**",
                "Global info: an `@Bean OpenAPI` with `new OpenAPI().info(new Info().title(...).version(...))`",
                "Bearer JWT: `components(new Components().addSecuritySchemes(...))` on the same bean"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Example: GET /users/{id}",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "@Tag(name = \"Users\")",
                "@Operation(summary = \"Get user\")",
                "@ApiResponse(responseCode = \"404\",",
                "    description = \"Not found\")",
                "@GetMapping(\"/users/{id}\")",
                "UserDto get(@PathVariable Long id)",
                "",
                "@Schema(example = \"alice@x.com\") String email;"
              ],
              "note": "the last line sits on the DTO field"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Gotchas",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`@Hidden` removes an internal endpoint or parameter",
                "Return {green:DTOs}, not JPA entities: the schema **leaks internals**",
                "Error types from `@RestControllerAdvice` get documented as responses"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Never expose entities. Annotate the ==DTO==, and declare error types so the spec shows them."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "springdoc Configuration and Environment Control",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "springdoc Configuration and Environment Control",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Key Properties",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "yaml",
              "lines": [
                "springdoc:",
                "  api-docs:",
                "    path: /v3/api-docs",
                "  swagger-ui:",
                "    path: /swagger-ui.html",
                "    operationsSorter: method",
                "    tags-sorter: alpha"
              ],
              "note": "spec path, UI path, sort operations by method, tags A-Z"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Scope and Groups",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`springdoc.packages-to-scan` limits docs by ==package==",
                "`springdoc.paths-to-match` limits docs by ==URL pattern==",
                "`GroupedOpenApi` beans split one app into **several specs**",
                "Example: a {green:public} group and an {red:admin} group"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Prod Switch and Security",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "yaml",
              "lines": [
                "# application-prod.yml",
                "springdoc:",
                "  api-docs:",
                "    enabled: false",
                "  swagger-ui:",
                "    enabled: false"
              ],
              "note": "set per profile, so dev keeps the docs"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Spring Security blocks `/v3/api-docs/**` and `/swagger-ui/**` by default",
                "Either ==permitAll== them, or protect them **deliberately**"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Gotchas",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Public Swagger UI in prod exposes your ==full API surface==",
                "Custom context-path or proxy prefix: set `springdoc.swagger-ui.config-url` or the server URL to match"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Logback Configuration and Log Levels per Package",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Logback Configuration and Log Levels per Package",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Levels and Packages",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Boot logs with ==Logback== via `spring-boot-starter-logging`",
                "Order: ==TRACE < DEBUG < INFO < WARN < ERROR==",
                "Root default is {green:INFO}",
                "==Most specific== package wins; children inherit the parent level"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "yaml",
              "lines": [
                "logging:",
                "  level:",
                "    root: WARN",
                "    com.myapp.service: DEBUG",
                "    org.hibernate.SQL: DEBUG"
              ],
              "note": "application.yml"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Custom Config",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Name it ==logback-spring.xml==, not `logback.xml`",
                "Enables `<springProfile>` and `<springProperty>`",
                "Core tags: `<appender>`, `<logger name level additivity>`, `<root>`",
                "Rolling policy rotates by date and size; ==totalSizeCap== stops a full disk"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "xml",
              "lines": [
                "<appender name=\"FILE\" class=\"ch.qos.logback.core.rolling.RollingFileAppender\">",
                "<rollingPolicy class=\"ch.qos.logback.core.rolling.SizeAndTimeBasedRollingPolicy\">",
                "<fileNamePattern>logs/app.%d{yyyy-MM-dd}.%i.log</fileNamePattern>",
                "<maxFileSize>50MB</maxFileSize>",
                "<maxHistory>14</maxHistory>",
                "<totalSizeCap>2GB</totalSizeCap>",
                "</rollingPolicy><encoder><pattern>%d %p %c %m%n</pattern></encoder>",
                "</appender>"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Gotchas",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Child logger with own appender and `additivity=true` ==duplicates== every line",
                "Fix: `additivity=false`",
                "Live level change: POST `/actuator/loggers/{name}` with `{\"configuredLevel\":\"DEBUG\"}`"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Levels: most specific logger wins. Appenders: they ==add up== up the tree unless additivity is false."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Structured JSON Logs, MDC and Trace IDs",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Structured JSON Logs, MDC and Trace IDs",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Structured JSON",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==One JSON object per line==: ELK, Loki, CloudWatch filter by field",
                "Pre-3.4 encoder fields: `StructuredArguments.kv(\"orderId\", id)`"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Boot",
                "How"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "3.4+",
                  "`logging.structured.format.console=ecs` (or logstash, gelf)"
                ],
                [
                  "Before 3.4",
                  "logstash-logback-encoder: `LogstashEncoder` in `logback-spring.xml`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. MDC and trace IDs",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "MDC is a ==per-thread map==: `MDC.put(\"traceId\", id)`",
                "Pattern reads it with `%X{traceId}`",
                "JSON encoders add all MDC entries as fields"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "String id = Optional.ofNullable(req.getHeader(\"X-Request-Id\"))",
                "    .orElse(UUID.randomUUID().toString());",
                "try {",
                "  MDC.put(\"traceId\", id);",
                "  res.setHeader(\"X-Request-Id\", id);",
                "  chain.doFilter(req, res);",
                "} finally { MDC.clear(); }"
              ],
              "note": "inside a OncePerRequestFilter"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Gotchas",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "MDC is ThreadLocal: lost on `@Async`, executors, reactive chains",
                "Copy it with a `TaskDecorator` or Reactor context propagation",
                "Never log passwords, tokens or PII"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Micrometer Tracing",
              "text": "Boot auto-populates ==traceId== and ==spanId== in MDC. Always clear MDC in `finally`."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Cheat Sheet: Docs and Logging",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 5,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Cheat Sheet: Docs and Logging",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. springdoc Setup",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Item",
                "Value"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Starter",
                  "`springdoc-openapi-starter-webmvc-ui`"
                ],
                [
                  "Spec JSON",
                  "`/v3/api-docs`"
                ],
                [
                  "Swagger UI",
                  "`/swagger-ui/index.html`"
                ],
                [
                  "{red:Prod switch}",
                  "`springdoc.api-docs.enabled=false`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Annotations",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Annotation",
                "Use"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`@Tag`",
                  "controller"
                ],
                [
                  "`@Operation`",
                  "method"
                ],
                [
                  "`@ApiResponse`",
                  "status code"
                ],
                [
                  "`@Schema`",
                  "field"
                ],
                [
                  "`@Hidden`",
                  "exclude"
                ],
                [
                  "`GroupedOpenApi`",
                  "split specs"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Log Levels and Config",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==TRACE < DEBUG < INFO < WARN < ERROR==",
                "Set: `logging.level.<package>=LEVEL`",
                "Live: `POST /actuator/loggers/<name>`",
                "`logback-spring.xml` handles profiles and appenders",
                "`additivity=false` stops {red:duplicate lines}",
                "Rolling policy needs ==totalSizeCap=="
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. JSON and MDC",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "JSON logs: `logging.structured.format.console=ecs` (Boot 3.4+)",
                "Pattern reads the ID with `%X{traceId}`",
                "Filter: `MDC.put`, then `MDC.clear` in ==finally=="
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "MDC.put(\"traceId\", id);",
                "try {",
                "  chain.doFilter(req, res);",
                "} finally {",
                "  MDC.clear();",
                "}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Always clear",
              "text": "Skip `MDC.clear` and pooled threads leak old trace IDs."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Check yourself",
      "role": "quiz",
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Check yourself",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "A Boot 3 app adds `springdoc-openapi-ui`. Swagger UI is blank or startup fails. What is wrong?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "That artifact is for Boot 2",
                "Use `springdoc-openapi-starter-webmvc-ui`, and no springfox"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "`com.myapp.service` has its own CONSOLE appender, and root also uses CONSOLE. How many times does each line print?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "Twice: additivity is true, so the event also reaches root's appender",
                "Set `additivity=false` on that logger"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "A filter does `MDC.put(\"traceId\", id)`. An `@Async` method logs with `%X{traceId}`. What shows?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "Empty: MDC is a ThreadLocal and the executor runs on another thread",
                "Copy it with a `TaskDecorator`"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
